{"id":"864a35781ae3b23f","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-hrs-object-beta.md","title":"HRS 的对象层 β 规则","display":"ex-hrs-object-beta — HRS 的对象层 β 规则","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-hrs-object-beta","aliases":["56-ex-hrs-object-beta"],"display":"ex-hrs-object-beta — HRS 的对象层 β 规则","depends_on":["[[56-df-lambda-term]]","[[56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Examples 11.2.22(ii),11.2.26(ii), printed pp597–599","source_ocr_block":"618–620","verification_status":"source-example-compared; type-and-instance-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-hrs-object-beta"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-hrs-object-beta</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-hrs-object-beta — HRS 的对象层 β 规则"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7d107c2c14774de\" href=\"?note=c7d107c2c14774de\" title=\"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system\">56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Examples 11.2.22(ii),11.2.26(ii), printed pp597–599"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"618–620"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-example-compared; type-and-instance-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取基本类型集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\">\\(\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\)</span> 为两个互异常元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}\">\\(F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}\">\\(z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,x\\in V_o\">\\(w,x\\in V_o\\)</span>。常元类型图由下式给出，原始语法取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d547d7414660f6bd\" href=\"?note=d547d7414660f6bd\" title=\"56-df-lambda-term\">56-df-lambda-term</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,\\nu_o,\\bar w\">\\(H,\\nu_o,\\bar w\\)</span>、合法规则与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_H\">\\(\\to_H\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7d107c2c14774de\" href=\"?note=c7d107c2c14774de\" title=\"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system\">56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system</a> 的内部依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau_F\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{abs},(o\\Rightarrow o)\\Rightarrow o),\n(\\mathsf{app},o\\Rightarrow o\\Rightarrow o)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau_F\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{abs},(o\\Rightarrow o)\\Rightarrow o),\n(\\mathsf{app},o\\Rightarrow o\\Rightarrow o)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.zx))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\nU\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.zw]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad R\\coloneqq\\{(L,U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.zx))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\nU\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.zw]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad R\\coloneqq\\{(L,U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.x]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\ns\\coloneqq[\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.x))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.x]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\ns\\coloneqq[\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.x))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HRS}(F,\\tau_F,R),\\qquad s\\to_H\\bar w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HRS}(F,\\tau_F,R),\\qquad s\\to_H\\bar w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu_o(La\\bar w)=s,\\qquad\\nu_o(Ua\\bar w)=\\bar w.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu_o(La\\bar w)=s,\\qquad\\nu_o(Ua\\bar w)=\\bar w.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本例保持原来的对象层 β 规则与示范步骤，仅显式区分原始代表元和高阶项的 α 类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 的类型是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\\Rightarrow o\">\\(o\\Rightarrow o\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar w\">\\(\\bar w\\)</span> 的类型是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o\">\\(o\\)</span>，因此两次 ν 调用都在定义域内。左部自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 作用于局部绑定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 的参数列表为空；它们满足模式限制。元层 β 计算给出最后两个等式，遂产生对象层一步。</p>\n<p>原文件来源定位为 Terese (2003) 的高阶重写 β 示例；本次按已给定的形式化内部接口复核该实例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-lambda-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"c7d107c2c14774de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-lambda-term","status":"resolved","id":"d547d7414660f6bd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取基本类型集 $\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}$。$\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}$ 为两个互异常元，$F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}$；$z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}$、$w,x\\in V_o$。常元类型图由下式给出，原始语法取 [[56-df-lambda-term]]。$H,\\nu_o,\\bar w$、合法规则与 $\\to_H$ 采用 [[56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system]] 的内部依赖。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"c7d107c2c14774de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取基本类型集 $\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}$。$\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}$ 为两个互异常元，$F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}$；$z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}$、$w,x\\in V_o$。常元类型图由下式给出，原始语法取 [[56-df-lambda-term]]。$H,\\nu_o,\\bar w$、合法规则与 $\\to_H$ 采用 [[56-df-higher-order-rewrite-system]] 的内部依赖。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B=\\{o\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\{\\mathsf{abs},\\mathsf{app}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in V_{o\\Rightarrow o}","display":false},{"tex":"w,x\\in V_o","display":false},{"tex":"H,\\nu_o,\\bar w","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_H","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_F\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\mathsf{abs},(o\\Rightarrow o)\\Rightarrow o),\n(\\mathsf{app},o\\Rightarrow o\\Rightarrow o)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"L\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.zx))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\nU\\coloneqq[\\lambda z.\\lambda w.zw]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad R\\coloneqq\\{(L,U)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\coloneqq[\\lambda x.x]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau},\\qquad\ns\\coloneqq[\\mathsf{app}(\\mathsf{abs}(\\lambda x.x))w]_{\\alpha,E_\\tau}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HRS}(F,\\tau_F,R),\\qquad s\\to_H\\bar w.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu_o(La\\bar w)=s,\\qquad\\nu_o(Ua\\bar w)=\\bar w.","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"o\\Rightarrow o","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar w","display":false},{"tex":"o","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false}],"bytes":2004,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-306","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-hrs-object-beta.md]]"}],"outgoing":["d547d7414660f6bd","c7d107c2c14774de"]}